    <!-- About dialog -->
    <string name="about_title">About &amp; verification</string>
    <string name="about_verified">Verified after every download</string>
    <string name="about_verified_body">The package is parsed and its signing certificate digest is recorded before the install button appears. Where a source publishes a sha-256, the download is compared with it first.</string>
    <string name="about_cannot_prove">What it cannot prove</string>
    <string name="about_cannot_prove_body">This catalogue publishes no file hashes or signatures, so verification establishes integrity and identity locally — not that the catalogue meant to serve this file.</string>
    <string name="about_updates">Updates</string>
    <string name="about_updates_body">Apps installed from here are compared build label against build label, so an update goes in place. Other apps on the device are matched against the catalogue\'s listing and checked for a strictly newer version; those are only fetched when you ask, because a build published by someone else may not install over the one you have.</string>
    <string name="about_close">Close</string>
    <string name="about_servers">The servers</string>
    <string name="about_servers_body">This app hosts nothing. It reads LiteAPKs, 9MOD, 5play, GetModsAPK, AN1 and ApkVision, and the files come from those sites\' own storage servers. Each of them keeps the ownership of its content and its trademarks. Thanks to the people who run them.</string>

